    "description": {
      "value": "Moss and winding vines give this gnarled staff of wild wood a vibrant green tinge. You created this staff to aid you in speaking to the plants you met on your adventure and beseeching them to come to your aid. You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. 5th plant form, wall of thorns 6th nature's reprisal, plant form"
